   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Ornamental Plants Survey</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Ornamental Plants in Urban Green Space: Preference\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Zheng et al. (2022), Forests 13:1871: view 19 photographs of ornamental plants in urban green space (vegetation type, flower colour, leaf colour, layers) for 15 seconds each, then rate how much you like each one (1–5).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"plants\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"intro\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part and know I can stop at any time.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"ratings\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"custom\",\n      \"name\": \"plant_preference\",\n      \"title\": \"How much do you like this picture?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"All 19 pictures are first viewed one at a time (15 s each, 5 s blank between, random order), then each is rated in a new random order. One trial per picture (key i_a … iv_d, labelled as in the paper's Supplementary Figure S1: I vegetation type A–F, II flower colour A–F, III leaf colour A–C, IV layer A–D). Value: 1 = strongly dislike, 2 = dislike, 3 = average, 4 = like, 5 = strongly like.\",\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Strongly dislike\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Dislike\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Average\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"Like\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"Strongly like\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"i_a\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetation type: grassland\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"i_b\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetation type: shrub\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"i_c\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetation type: broad-leaf tree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"i_d\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetation type: coniferous tree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"i_e\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetation type: bamboo\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"i_f\",\n        \"label\": \"Vegetation type: palm\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ii_a\",\n        \"label\": \"Flower colour: blue\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ii_b\",\n        \"label\": \"Flower colour: red\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ii_c\",\n        \"label\": \"Flower colour: pink\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ii_d\",\n        \"label\": \"Flower colour: purple\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ii_e\",\n        \"label\": \"Flower colour: white\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"ii_f\",\n        \"label\": \"Flower colour: yellow\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iii_a\",\n        \"label\": \"Leaf colour: green\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iii_b\",\n        \"label\": \"Leaf colour: yellow\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iii_c\",\n        \"label\": \"Leaf colour: red\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iv_a\",\n        \"label\": \"Layer: tree + shrub + grass\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iv_b\",\n        \"label\": \"Layer: shrub + grass\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iv_c\",\n        \"label\": \"Layer: shrub\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"iv_d\",\n        \"label\": \"Layer: grass\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"home_climate\",\n      \"title\": \"Which climate zone is your home region in?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Temperate\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Tropical or subtropical\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Other / not sure\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#eff3ec;--card:#fff;--ink:#22201b;--muted:#625c50;--accent:#4a6b2a;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d5ddd0;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:18px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:200px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n.pic{background:#ddd;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:min(52vh,480px)}\n.pic img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px;margin-top:12px}\n.scale button{appearance:none;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 4px;font:inherit;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.25;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink);min-height:64px}\n.scale button b{display:block;font-size:1.1rem}\n.scale button:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.view{position:relative}.cd{position:absolute;right:10px;top:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.blank{height:min(52vh,480px);background:#888;border-radius:12px}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n@media (max-width:560px){.pic{height:auto;max-height:50vh}.pic img{max-height:50vh}.scale{grid-template-columns:1fr}.scale button{min-height:0;text-align:left;padding:9px 12px}.scale button b{display:inline;margin-right:8px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Zheng, Huang, Chen, Guan &amp; Liu (2022), Forests 13:1871, doi:10.3390/f13111871, Supplementary Figure S1 (CC BY 4.0). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='ornamental2022:', IDS=['i_a','i_b','i_c','i_d','i_e','i_f','ii_a','ii_b','ii_c','ii_d','ii_e','ii_f','iii_a','iii_b','iii_c','iv_a','iv_b','iv_c','iv_d'], N=IDS.length, timer=null, vorder=[], viewed=0;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, done={}, order=[], SPEC=null, SCALE=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){\n    clearInterval(timer);app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;\n  }\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    if(viewed<N&&!order.some(function(k){return done[k];}))return view();\n    for(var i=0;i<order.length;i++){if(!done[order[i]])return photo(i);}\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    if(IDS.some(function(k){return !files[k+'.jpg'];})){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder plants must hold i_a.jpg … iv_d.jpg.</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Ornamental plants in urban green space</h1><p>This survey is about plants in city parks and green spaces. First you will see 19 photographs, one at a time, for 15 seconds each with a short grey pause in between: just look at them; you do not need to do anything. This part takes about 6 minutes. Then you will see each photograph again and say how much you like it, from 1 (strongly dislike) to 5 (strongly like). There are no right or wrong answers and your answers are anonymous.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function view(){\n    var k=vorder[viewed], f=files[k+'.jpg'], left=15;\n    clearInterval(timer);\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Looking: photograph '+(viewed+1)+' of '+N+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*viewed/N)+'%\"></i></div></div><div class=\"card view\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Ornamental plants photograph\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><span class=\"cd\" id=\"cd\">15</span></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px\">Just look at the photograph.</p>';\n    timer=setInterval(function(){left--;var c=document.getElementById('cd');if(c)c.textContent=left;\n      if(left===0){var p=app.querySelector('.pic');if(p){p.style.background='#888';p.querySelector('img').style.visibility='hidden';}if(c)c.style.display='none';}\n      if(left<=-5){clearInterval(timer);viewed++;save('viewed',viewed);next();}},1000);\n  }\n  function about(){\n    var ns=['gender','age','home_climate'];\n    var h=ns.map(function(n){var d=q(n);if(d.type!=='radiogroup')return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b><input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" name=\"'+n+'\"></div>';\n      return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b>'+(d.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('');\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\">'+h+'</div>','Finish',function(){\n      var l=[];for(var i=0;i<ns.length;i++){var n=ns[i];if(n==='age'){var a=Number(app.querySelector('input[name=age]').value.trim());if(!a||a<16||a>110)return err('Please enter your age in years.');l.push(['age',a]);continue;}\n        var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer: '+q(n).title);l.push([n,Number(x.value)]);}\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll(l,b,function(){ans.about=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function photo(i){\n    var k=order[i], f=files[k+'.jpg'], n=0;order.forEach(function(x){if(done[x])n++;});\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Rating: photograph '+(n+1)+' of '+N+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*n/N)+'%\"></i></div></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Ornamental plants photograph\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><div class=\"q\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>'+esc(q('plant_preference').title)+'</b></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"scale\">'+SCALE.map(function(c){return '<button type=\"button\" data-v=\"'+c.value+'\"><b>'+c.value+'</b>'+esc(c.text)+'</button>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    [].forEach.call(app.querySelectorAll('.scale button'),function(btn){btn.onclick=function(){\n      [].forEach.call(app.querySelectorAll('.scale button'),function(x){x.disabled=true;});\n      SPSite.answer('plant_preference',Number(btn.dataset.v),{key:k,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){[].forEach.call(app.querySelectorAll('.scale button'),function(x){x.disabled=false;});return err(r.error);}done[k]=true;next();});\n    };});\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>The 19 photographs showed four kinds of ornamental plant attributes: vegetation type, flower colour, leaf colour and planting layers. In the original eye-tracking study with 90 young adults, mostly from tropical and subtropical regions of China, people liked trees with shrubs and grass, blue, red and pink flowers, broad-leaf trees and bamboo best; coniferous trees, white flowers, green leaves and plain grass scored lower, although these differences were small. Plants that people rated higher also drew more and longer looks.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photographs and scale: Zheng, J., Huang, Y., Chen, Y., Guan, L., &amp; Liu, Q. (2022). Subjective preference and visual attention to the attributes of ornamental plants in urban green space: an eye-tracking study. Forests 13:1871, doi:10.3390/f13111871.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='plant_preference'){done={};viewed=N;}else ans.about=false;});save('a',ans);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={type:e.type,title:g.title||e.title,isRequired:e.isRequired,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};});});\n    SCALE=q('plant_preference').choices||[];\n    (SPSite.getMedia('plants')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var o=load('order');if(!o||o.length!==N)o=shuffle(IDS);order=o;save('order',order);var vo=load('vorder');if(!vo||vo.length!==N)vo=shuffle(IDS);vorder=vo;save('vorder',vorder);viewed=load('viewed')||0;\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};ans=load('a')||{};\n    ((a.plant_preference&&a.plant_preference.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===true;ans.about=a.home_climate!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
